steps.prompt:
Create the instruction set for a new CloudWorld world. Follow the create-cloudworld-world skill, steps 1 to 4.

worldId: {{worldId}}
worldName: {{worldName}}
referenceImage: {{referenceImage}} (a file name inside docs/images/, or 'none' when there is no image)
brief: {{brief}}

Copy worlds/_template to worlds/{{worldId}}. If referenceImage is not 'none', read it and list its exact docs/images/ path under reference_images in world.md. Otherwise write the brief into the front matter and describe the look in words. Fill in world.md and resources.md, then run `npm run validate:worlds` and fix every error. Do not build 3D models in this step.

When the resource list is ready, call send_message with severity warning and ask the user to review worlds/{{worldId}}/resources.md and adjust any looks. Continue only after the user confirms, then finish with send_message severity success and a one-paragraph summary.
